Melas-Kyriazi, L. (2021, May 6). Do You Even Need Attention? A Stack of Feed-Forward Layers Does Surprisingly Well on ImageNet. arXiv. [https://arxiv.org/pdf/2105.02723v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2105.02723v1)

